message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
title: Sparse Feature Correspondence Between Language Models and fMRI
type: software
version: 0.1.4
date-released: 2026-09-04
authors:
  - family-names: Mora
    given-names: Daniel
repository-code: https://github.com/daMS2005/sparse-feature-correspondence
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Source code, analysis configuration, sanitized power aggregates, and
  deterministic reports supporting an evaluation of sparse-feature
  correspondence between language models and fMRI responses. Restricted
  participant-level data and model assets are not redistributed.
keywords:
  - functional magnetic resonance imaging
  - sparse autoencoders
  - language models
  - representational correspondence
  - reproducibility
